<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Network started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Network started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Orion Network Systems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Orion's strong array of orbital slots, regional operating licenses and blue-chip multinational customers are significant barriers to entry and offer strategic value,&quot; a Lehman summary report said.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 14-1/8.</p>
</text>
